***REMOVED*** ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** copyparty Secret — /cfg/copyparty.conf (accounts + volume permissions).
***REMOVED*** SOPS-encrypted (age). Auto-loaded by copyparty from /cfg/*.conf.
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED***   cp copyparty-secret.yaml.example copyparty-secret.yaml
***REMOVED***   $EDITOR copyparty-secret.yaml   ***REMOVED*** set passwords
***REMOVED***   sops -e -i copyparty-secret.yaml
***REMOVED*** ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
  name: copyparty
  namespace: copyparty
stringData:
  config: |
    [global]
      e2dsa  ***REMOVED*** filesystem indexing (search)
      e2ts   ***REMOVED*** multimedia indexing (tags/thumbs)
      hist: /cfg/hists  ***REMOVED*** keep .hist (db + thumbs) on the PVC, media mount is RO
      acao: https://files.example.com,https://files.k8s.example.com  ***REMOVED*** explicit origins; default * strips cookies/basic-auth
      xff-src: 10.244.0.0/16  ***REMOVED*** trust envoy x-forwarded-* headers -> real client IPs
      no-acode   ***REMOVED*** no ffmpeg audio transcoding
      no-bacode  ***REMOVED*** no audio transcode in zip/tar folder downloads

    [accounts]
      bombom: REPLACE_WITH_BOMBOM_PASSWORD
      friends: REPLACE_WITH_FRIENDS_PASSWORD

    [/media]
      /srv/media
      accs:
        r: bombom, friends  ***REMOVED*** read-only for these accounts; anonymous gets nothing
